Big-endian PowerPC AltiVec (G4/G5/e6500, 32/64-bit, no VSX): ARCH_PPC_ALTIVEC with run-time detection (Darwin
hw.vectorunit, Linux AT_HWCAP) and 8-bit 8-tap put/prep (all nine filter pairs) plus avg in src/ppc/mc_altivec_tmpl.c.
Bit-exact: dav1d --muxer md5 equal to --cpumask 0 and to the host decoder. LEOPARD_DAV1D_NO_ALTIVEC_MC=1 for A/B.

